            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dany's Video 0.4.26</h2>
<ul>
<li>Use my location works for the sky. Before, the Mac app always refused it, and only a city or typed coordinates worked. macOS asks for permission the first time; the place is rounded to about a kilometre.</li>
<li>Open sky: while star gazing from the bed, double-click the sky. You rise a little, the room fades away and only the sky is left. Esc brings you back down.</li>
</ul>
